    "updated_at": "2018-05-29T16:40:07Z",
    "body": "I think I added the reset because of `<img>` and the way `<iframe>` works (which is \"navigate\", not \"no-cors\"). And because I was sloppy I didn't test `fetch()` I guess. I'm not entirely sure yet how to fix this, but I agree with you on the desirable outcome.",
